---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../site";
---

<Base
  title="About Tim Tsoi"
  description="Tim Tsoi is an engineer based in Japan, working across security, infrastructure, and software."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ME</p>
    <h1>
      Hi, I’m Tim<span class="accent-period">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      I’m an engineer based in Japan, working across security, infrastructure,
      and software. I write code, build systems, and keep them secure and
      running.
    </p>
    <p>
      Throughout my career, I’ve been the most senior individual contributor on
      my teams, and at times the only engineer. I take responsibility for the
      technical decisions and stay hands-on with the implementation.
    </p>
    <p>
      I write about projects I’ve worked on, what went well, what didn’t, and
      why.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you’d like to talk about security engineering or working together, you
      can find me on LinkedIn.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href={site.linkedin}>
      Connect on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Base>
